WEBVTT

00:08:30.422 --> 00:08:33.175
In South Asia, 4,500 years ago,

00:08:33.217 --> 00:08:37.555
the first cities appeared
at places like Mohenjo-daro

00:08:37.555 --> 00:08:39.890
and Harappa in the Indus Valley.

00:08:40.391 --> 00:08:46.897
But these huge settlements present
no evidence of kings or queens.

00:08:48.983 --> 00:08:52.653
No royal monuments, no aggrandizing art.

00:08:52.695 --> 00:08:56.365
And what's more, we know
that much of the population

00:08:56.407 --> 00:09:00.494
lived in high-quality housing
with excellent sanitation.